body:
Please simplify this block a bit, it currently has some superfluous match arms, instead of `match` I feel like combinators are appropriate here:
```rs
let state = serde_json::from_str::<RawDirenvState>(direnv_status)
    .ok()
    .and_then(|raw| raw.into_direnv_state().inspect_err(|e| log::warn!("Failed... :{e}")).ok())
    .flatten()
    .or_else(|| {
        DirenvState::from_lines(direnv_status)
            .inspect_err(|e| log::warn!("Failed....: {e}"))
            .ok()
    })?;
```

